{"seq":27,"slug":"executive-communication","title":"高管沟通与影响力","stage":"DONE","category":"management","chapterCount":4,"docCount":15,"url":"/h/management/executive-communication","rating":{"composite":3.89,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":4.5,"strategic":3.67},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.49,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":3.5}},"introMarkdown":"# 高管沟通与影响力\n\n## 为什么需要这个文档族\n\n在中层管理之前，\"做事\"占主导——你的影响力来自把事情完成的能力。到了高管层，\"沟通与影响力\"占主导——你的影响力来自如何把战略说清楚、让董事会信服、让 1000 人组织对齐、让市场看见你。许多优秀的中层经理在升任高管后失败，不是因为业务能力不够，而是因为高管沟通是一组完全不同的能力：与董事会沟通需要不同的语言、与投资者沟通需要不同的框架、与全员沟通需要不同的故事、与媒体沟通需要不同的纪律。本文档族系统讲解高管沟通与影响力的工程实践。\n\n```mermaid\ngraph TD\n    A[高管沟通与影响力] --> B[高管气场与可信度]\n    A --> C[战略沟通]\n    A --> D[向上影响]\n    A --> E[公共影响力]\n    B --> F[谁是你 + 你能做什么]\n    C --> G[董事会、投资者、全员、危机]\n    D --> H[向 CEO 与董事会施加影响]\n    E --> I[媒体、演讲、思想领导力]\n```\n\n| 章节       | 关键问题             | 适合谁        |\n| ---------- | -------------------- | ------------- |\n| 高管气场   | 如何建立可信度与气场 | 准高管 / 高管 |\n| 战略沟通   | 不同受众如何沟通     | C 级、VP      |\n| 向上影响   | 如何向更高层施加影响 | VP、Director  |\n| 公共影响力 | 媒体、演讲、个人品牌 | C 级、CEO     |\n\n读完本文档族，你应能建立高管气场、设计针对不同受众（董事会、投资者、全员、媒体）的战略沟通、有效向上影响、用公共平台放大影响力。这是从\"业务高管\"升级为\"组织级领导者\"的关键能力。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"executive-presence","title":"高管气场与可信度","docCount":4,"url":"/h/management/executive-communication/executive-presence","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"what-is-executive-presence","title":"什么是高管气场","url":"/h/management/executive-communication/executive-presence/what-is-executive-presence"},{"seq":2,"slug":"gravitas-and-confidence","title":"Gravitas 与自信","url":"/h/management/executive-communication/executive-presence/gravitas-and-confidence"},{"seq":3,"slug":"executive-storytelling","title":"高管讲故事","url":"/h/management/executive-communication/executive-presence/executive-storytelling"},{"seq":4,"slug":"credibility-building","title":"可信度建设","url":"/h/management/executive-communication/executive-presence/credibility-building"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"strategic-communication","title":"战略沟通","docCount":4,"url":"/h/management/executive-communication/strategic-communication","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"board-communication","title":"董事会沟通","url":"/h/management/executive-communication/strategic-communication/board-communication"},{"seq":2,"slug":"investor-communication","title":"投资者沟通","url":"/h/management/executive-communication/strategic-communication/investor-communication"},{"seq":3,"slug":"all-hands-communication","title":"全员沟通","url":"/h/management/executive-communication/strategic-communication/all-hands-communication"},{"seq":4,"slug":"crisis-communication","title":"危机沟通","url":"/h/management/executive-communication/strategic-communication/crisis-communication"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"upward-influence","title":"向上影响","docCount":4,"url":"/h/management/executive-communication/upward-influence","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"managing-up","title":"向上协作（Managing Up）","url":"/h/management/executive-communication/upward-influence/managing-up"},{"seq":2,"slug":"selling-ideas","title":"推销想法","url":"/h/management/executive-communication/upward-influence/selling-ideas"},{"seq":3,"slug":"navigating-power","title":"权力导航","url":"/h/management/executive-communication/upward-influence/navigating-power"},{"seq":4,"slug":"disagreeing-with-leaders","title":"与上级的分歧","url":"/h/management/executive-communication/upward-influence/disagreeing-with-leaders"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"public-presence","title":"公共影响力","docCount":3,"url":"/h/management/executive-communication/public-presence","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"media-and-press","title":"媒体与新闻应对","url":"/h/management/executive-communication/public-presence/media-and-press"},{"seq":2,"slug":"keynote-and-speech","title":"Keynote 与演讲","url":"/h/management/executive-communication/public-presence/keynote-and-speech"},{"seq":3,"slug":"thought-leadership","title":"思想领导力","url":"/h/management/executive-communication/public-presence/thought-le